What is the third ratio that, when multiplied by the first ratio, gives the second ratio? [asy]
pair A=(0,0), B=(10,0), C=(8,5), D=(1,5);
draw(A--B--C--A, linewidth(1));
draw(B--D);
label("$20$", B, S);
